# SECURITY NOTE (Qodo): ignore every environment-file variant â€” `.env`,
# `.env.production`, `.env.local`, `.env.staging`, `*.env`, etc. â€” so API keys,
# `.env.example` stays tracked as the template for local setup.
# Keep the canonical template committed â€” do NOT remove the line above:
# `!.env.example` re-includes the template that `.env*` would otherwise
# blanket-ignore.

# ==== ENV SECRETS (never commit) ====
# CI/pre-commit: run gitleaks (or equivalent secret scan) before pushing.
.env
.env.*
*.env.local
!.env.example
